WEBVTT

00:01.267 --> 00:05.465
Studio kajino presents

00:07.474 --> 00:09.704
once upon a time

00:09.809 --> 00:12.277
returning to my hometown

00:32.165 --> 00:34.656
the 1st day 30 days remain

01:11.271 --> 01:12.602
do you sell cigarettes?

01:12.739 --> 01:15.037
We don't carry them

01:15.141 --> 01:16.608
i'm sorry

01:21.014 --> 01:22.242
out of cigarettes?

01:22.348 --> 01:23.542
Yeah

01:33.493 --> 01:34.790
thanks

01:40.733 --> 01:41.961
ritual

01:43.670 --> 01:45.160
it's a ritual

01:48.741 --> 01:51.107
oh, before?
By the tracks?

01:52.579 --> 01:55.776
Yes, i was performing a ritual

01:57.450 --> 02:01.386
oh... sorry i intruded then

02:03.656 --> 02:04.884
what's it for?

02:06.092 --> 02:07.320
It's a secret!

02:14.934 --> 02:17.801
Do you know what tomorrow is?

02:19.839 --> 02:20.806
No

02:22.108 --> 02:23.575
tomorrow s

02:23.977 --> 02:25.376
my

02:25.545 --> 02:26.512
birthday

02:26.646 --> 02:29.444
ritual

02:29.549 --> 02:32.017
the 2nd day 29 days remain

02:41.895 --> 02:45.353
i'm still swirling

02:45.632 --> 02:48.499
it's a dark, lonely place

02:49.102 --> 02:53.436
i thought you could
maybe rescue me

02:54.207 --> 02:57.176
somehow, i still feel that way

02:58.144 --> 03:00.408
unsure what to do

03:00.847 --> 03:04.248
i m moved
by the scent of rain

03:04.617 --> 03:06.608
thanks for those smokes

03:08.354 --> 03:09.753
and...

03:11.291 --> 03:13.020
happy birthday

03:14.460 --> 03:15.484
no!

03:16.663 --> 03:18.893
Tomorrow s my birthday

03:32.212 --> 03:34.680
the 3rd day 28 days remain

03:43.856 --> 03:46.848
the simple act of
pursuing her

03:46.960 --> 03:48.951
was sufficient

03:49.062 --> 03:53.328
having reached an impasse
in my work and in myself,

03:53.433 --> 03:55.492
i sought to
acquaint myself

03:55.602 --> 03:59.402
with everyday ennui,
sired by apathy and restlessness

04:00.106 --> 04:03.075
ever-fleeing the authenticity
of my own experience,

04:03.209 --> 04:06.508
i was entirely spent by a life,

04:06.613 --> 04:09.514
composed of accumulated fictions

04:16.256 --> 04:17.245
um...

04:17.957 --> 04:19.254
are you always alone?

04:20.193 --> 04:21.922
Not today

04:23.763 --> 04:25.162
yesterday?

04:26.266 --> 04:28.097
Not really

04:29.402 --> 04:30.869
tomorrow?

04:32.772 --> 04:34.797
I'd rather not be

04:37.644 --> 04:39.942
i'd rather not be alone either

04:41.281 --> 04:42.578
say,

04:44.050 --> 04:46.245
do you know today's date?

04:48.121 --> 04:49.019
Monday

04:49.122 --> 04:50.453
yesterday?

04:51.324 --> 04:52.188
Sunday

04:52.292 --> 04:53.418
tomorrow?

04:54.560 --> 04:55.492
Tuesday

04:56.262 --> 04:57.957
did you perform your ritual today?

04:58.531 --> 05:01.898
Yes
it will make my wish come true

05:02.001 --> 05:03.025
your wish?

05:03.436 --> 05:07.805
When my wish comes true,
i can disappear completely

05:08.041 --> 05:11.408
disappear, leaving nothing
in the world behind

05:11.911 --> 05:15.074
that's why i have to keep
performing the ritual

05:16.549 --> 05:19.985
until then, the red umbrella
protects me

05:27.727 --> 05:28.921
say,

05:29.529 --> 05:31.156
what's tomorrow?

05:33.933 --> 05:35.958
Can't you figure it out?

05:36.069 --> 05:39.766
Tomorrow is
my birthday

05:39.906 --> 05:41.373
and so...

05:42.208 --> 05:44.142
i d rather not be alone

05:44.243 --> 05:46.609
the 4th day 27 days remain

06:15.808 --> 06:16.775
um...

06:16.909 --> 06:17.933
what?

06:18.077 --> 06:21.945
Why did you follow me,
that first day?

06:22.048 --> 06:24.744
Why are you following me now?

06:24.851 --> 06:27.911
Well...
because you intrigue me

06:28.488 --> 06:30.479
same here, then

06:41.000 --> 06:42.831
this your place?

06:42.935 --> 06:44.061
Yup

06:48.174 --> 06:49.641
here?

06:54.380 --> 06:56.814
My unsound heart

06:57.850 --> 07:01.183
and the consuming ioneliness

07:01.287 --> 07:03.482
of longing for someone

07:04.557 --> 07:07.025
perhaps anyone will do

07:07.727 --> 07:11.424
as long as that someone

07:11.531 --> 07:13.328
will love me

07:13.599 --> 07:17.000
constantly, ceaselessly,

07:17.637 --> 07:20.037
it will suffice

07:22.708 --> 07:25.199
' is this true love?"

07:25.711 --> 07:29.238
' I feel at ease with you'

07:29.482 --> 07:31.541
' we're compatible '

07:31.951 --> 07:34.613
i ponder such ideas everyday

07:36.389 --> 07:37.913
sick

07:38.925 --> 07:41.393
dad and mom are sick

07:42.695 --> 07:44.720
everybody's sick

07:46.232 --> 07:48.325
and i'm...

07:49.268 --> 07:51.259
sickest of all

07:54.707 --> 07:56.038
what's wrong?

07:59.378 --> 08:02.836
Maybe i shouldn't have come

08:04.217 --> 08:06.378
it s not that

08:06.486 --> 08:09.717
no one's stood there before...

08:09.822 --> 08:11.949
i mean, it's unusual

08:12.158 --> 08:13.921
so i felt strange

08:14.527 --> 08:17.155
strange? Do i look weird?

08:17.730 --> 08:21.427
No, not at all
you look just right

08:22.335 --> 08:23.734
like my room?

08:28.541 --> 08:29.508
Probably

08:29.942 --> 08:31.170
i like it

08:31.277 --> 08:34.872
because only my
favorite things are here

08:38.284 --> 08:40.616
including me?

08:41.687 --> 08:45.350
Yup
you're one of the gang

08:46.125 --> 08:49.253
i'm ok here

08:49.862 --> 08:51.887
i like coming back here

08:55.401 --> 08:56.459
i m home, mother

08:59.705 --> 09:02.401
listen, your sister...

09:03.309 --> 09:04.901
you listening?

09:05.111 --> 09:07.705
She never listened to her mother

09:07.813 --> 09:09.974
it s too late for regrets now!

09:10.082 --> 09:13.483
Listen to me, or you'll
end up like your sister!

09:16.055 --> 09:19.923
Both of you share
that man s blood

09:20.293 --> 09:21.885
guess it's hopeless

09:23.529 --> 09:26.657
i've had it!
Where are you!

09:26.766 --> 09:29.166
Not with that man again

09:29.735 --> 09:32.260
i won t stand for it!

09:34.006 --> 09:36.167
Will you ever...

09:36.309 --> 09:38.709
pick up the phone and call me!

09:39.478 --> 09:41.742
All right, all right, i get it

09:42.214 --> 09:45.877
i worked myself
to the bone to raise you

09:46.385 --> 09:48.478
and now you abandon me

09:48.588 --> 09:51.785
at least your sister
had a heart

09:53.059 --> 09:54.549
how infuriating!

09:56.295 --> 09:57.990
Listen.

09:58.998 --> 10:01.592
You keep up this
selfish behavior

10:02.068 --> 10:04.332
and you ii pay for it

10:05.171 --> 10:06.798
i swear you will

10:08.441 --> 10:12.571
you, you, you...

10:12.945 --> 10:15.880
how dare you talk
to me that way

10:15.982 --> 10:19.816
your father tortured me,
doing whatever he wanted

10:19.919 --> 10:24.447
and now my own daughter
hates me so much!

10:24.790 --> 10:27.884
What's the point of living...

10:32.898 --> 10:36.026
i'll get out of the
hospital tomorrow,

10:36.702 --> 10:38.897
and it's your birthday, too

10:39.972 --> 10:43.271
please
won't you come home

10:43.376 --> 10:44.638
sure

11:23.649 --> 11:26.117
know what tomorrow is?

11:28.220 --> 11:30.916
Probably, your birthday, right?

11:31.190 --> 11:35.183
That's right
so let's play together again

11:35.461 --> 11:38.453
i don t want to be alone
on my birthday

11:46.405 --> 11:48.703
the 5th day 26 days remain

12:59.545 --> 13:01.035
what are you doing?

13:02.681 --> 13:06.811
Rainy days are days
for my father and sister

13:08.053 --> 13:10.044
they're both dead

13:11.991 --> 13:14.585
and tomorrow's my birthday...

13:15.561 --> 13:18.257
no doubt for her, the truth

13:18.364 --> 13:20.798
is only an enemy that wounds her

13:21.267 --> 13:26.261
the days of her life pass in
loneliness, a darkness without exit

13:26.739 --> 13:31.506
i longed to ease her sadness
and anxiety, if only a little

13:32.244 --> 13:36.180
even if only to atone
for my own past

13:57.670 --> 13:59.433
can i be with you?

14:00.573 --> 14:01.562
Yeah

14:05.778 --> 14:07.871
know what tomorrow is?

14:08.581 --> 14:10.811
Tomorrow's your birthday

14:18.958 --> 14:21.119
the 6th day 25 days remain

14:21.227 --> 14:22.421
the time is

14:22.528 --> 14:23.825
5: 59am

14:23.929 --> 14:24.896
and

14:24.997 --> 14:26.658
30 seconds

14:31.203 --> 14:32.568
the time is

14:32.705 --> 14:33.933
5: 59am

14:34.073 --> 14:35.005
and

14:35.107 --> 14:36.597
40 seconds

14:41.247 --> 14:42.475
the time is

14:42.581 --> 14:43.946
5: 59am

14:44.049 --> 14:44.947
and

14:45.050 --> 14:46.574
50 seconds

14:51.223 --> 14:53.088
the time is exactly

14:53.192 --> 14:54.750
6am

15:01.200 --> 15:02.462
the time is

15:02.568 --> 15:03.296
6am

15:03.402 --> 15:04.869
and 10 seconds

15:10.876 --> 15:12.207
good morning!

15:41.373 --> 15:43.170
I'm going to

15:43.375 --> 15:46.572
give you a tour of my house

15:46.946 --> 15:48.538
first,

15:49.248 --> 15:50.715
this is.

15:51.083 --> 15:53.483
The secret 4th floor

15:55.054 --> 15:57.648
and this...

16:07.399 --> 16:08.991
this is lucy

16:31.190 --> 16:32.782
the secret...

16:33.258 --> 16:34.282
3rd floor

16:36.862 --> 16:39.660
and this is...

16:44.169 --> 16:45.761
the secret

16:46.372 --> 16:47.339
2nd floor

16:50.576 --> 16:53.773
and this is...

16:54.446 --> 16:56.107
the secret

16:56.882 --> 16:57.974
1st floor

17:01.053 --> 17:02.748
there's a basement

17:03.922 --> 17:04.581
no!

17:04.690 --> 17:07.420
That s absolutely secret!
You can't go in there!

17:09.795 --> 17:12.855
And this is...

17:14.133 --> 17:15.930
the secret

17:17.202 --> 17:18.191
5th floor

17:20.139 --> 17:23.108
and this is

17:25.344 --> 17:26.811
the secret

17:27.813 --> 17:28.780
what?

17:29.348 --> 17:30.508
6th floor

17:30.616 --> 17:33.016
and this is

17:33.952 --> 17:35.681
the secret

17:39.691 --> 17:40.680
7th floor!

17:43.162 --> 17:44.891
Why are they all secret?

17:44.997 --> 17:46.487
Because...

17:47.699 --> 17:50.065
they're our secret

17:50.169 --> 17:52.399
and finally...

17:53.005 --> 17:54.370
this is

17:54.506 --> 17:55.996
the secret

17:56.475 --> 17:57.442
roof!

17:58.644 --> 18:02.375
These... stairs...
i'm beat

18:05.217 --> 18:06.548
getting old...

18:09.188 --> 18:11.156
you like high places?

18:11.256 --> 18:12.917
Not really

18:13.525 --> 18:14.958
i do

18:15.327 --> 18:18.922
sometimes,
i come here to check

18:19.031 --> 18:20.259
check what?

18:21.867 --> 18:23.562
That i'm still ok

18:46.658 --> 18:48.285
the sky is pretty

18:48.393 --> 18:50.020
the stars are pretty

18:50.129 --> 18:51.790
the moon is pretty

18:51.897 --> 18:53.626
the light is pretty

18:53.966 --> 18:56.230
if i don't exist,

18:56.568 --> 18:58.058
everything's pretty

18:58.437 --> 19:00.871
maybe it's better
if i didn't exist

19:02.674 --> 19:04.835
how about my blood?

19:05.511 --> 19:07.570
Maybe it's pretty

19:10.015 --> 19:11.107
maybe i ii look

19:25.230 --> 19:27.164
see, i'm still ok

19:27.566 --> 19:29.397
i didn't let go

19:31.303 --> 19:32.668
still ok to be alive

19:50.556 --> 19:52.922
a blank-faced mosquito falls

19:53.025 --> 19:54.049
a huge mosquito

19:54.159 --> 19:56.650
much, much bigger than i

19:56.762 --> 19:58.889
it slumps and is still

19:59.198 --> 20:02.599
a much larger
creature caught it

20:02.868 --> 20:06.599
and took flight, the mosquito
in its grasp

20:07.039 --> 20:10.634
it flew up and
passed right over me

20:10.776 --> 20:14.735
but it released its grasp and
the mosquito fell

20:15.280 --> 20:17.214
still blank

20:17.316 --> 20:19.784
it drifted down, down, down

20:21.720 --> 20:22.982
what's that?

20:23.088 --> 20:25.079
The inside of my head

20:26.091 --> 20:28.218
such an interesting head

20:28.393 --> 20:30.554
it's your turn

20:30.662 --> 20:32.527
to talk

20:33.332 --> 20:34.731
about what?

20:35.434 --> 20:36.833
Something

20:37.402 --> 20:39.302
something, huh

20:39.438 --> 20:42.771
anything
i want to hear you talk

20:46.211 --> 20:48.042
you know fireman?

20:48.480 --> 20:49.742
No

20:50.215 --> 20:53.082
well, when i was a kid,

20:53.185 --> 20:55.312
he was like ultraman

20:56.555 --> 21:00.685
his enemies attack him
and in the end, he dies

21:00.859 --> 21:02.850
he ignites

21:03.362 --> 21:04.454
so he dies

21:04.563 --> 21:07.896
fireman ends up burning

21:09.201 --> 21:13.695
he yells " fire! ' but
actually he's afraid of fire...

21:18.076 --> 21:20.738
maybe he's fireman
'cause he burns

21:21.647 --> 21:23.842
but that wasn't what you wanted

21:23.949 --> 21:26.884
i don't really get it,
but it's interesting

21:27.185 --> 21:30.348
that's what she says,
but i wonder...

21:30.555 --> 21:34.821
actually, all she wanted was
to hear someone's voice

21:35.160 --> 21:39.859
actually, all she wanted was
to stop feeling lonely

21:42.467 --> 21:44.332
know what tomorrow is?

21:45.871 --> 21:47.099
Your birthday, right?

22:00.886 --> 22:02.649
Echoes from the

22:02.754 --> 22:06.554
creaking arcade roof opening
and an all too ordinary sky

22:07.192 --> 22:10.491
disturbed my ease

22:12.631 --> 22:14.121
can i see you tomorrow?

22:15.967 --> 22:17.366
If i m still alive

22:17.469 --> 22:19.699
the 7th day 24 days remain

22:50.202 --> 22:51.863
you like cars?

22:53.238 --> 22:56.264
Not so well as boats and trains,

22:56.842 --> 22:58.241
but well enough

22:58.910 --> 23:00.400
i like 'em

23:00.846 --> 23:01.813
cars

23:01.947 --> 23:03.244
why?

23:03.348 --> 23:05.578
Because my big sister did

23:07.819 --> 23:09.548
where were you?

23:11.656 --> 23:14.489
I was back at the hotel
getting my things

23:14.593 --> 23:16.322
that stuff

23:17.028 --> 23:21.021
no, i mean where
were you 'til now

23:22.134 --> 23:24.398
i took my usual route here,

23:24.870 --> 23:27.202
the bookstore,
department store,

23:27.606 --> 23:29.233
and the toy store today

23:29.374 --> 23:31.842
no

23:32.878 --> 23:37.474
i mean where were you
before you came here!

23:38.750 --> 23:41.617
Oh... tokyo

23:44.055 --> 23:46.046
why d you come?

23:46.158 --> 23:50.618
What? I wanted
to think things over

23:51.196 --> 23:52.993
i was kind of tired

23:54.533 --> 23:56.228
tough time?

23:58.403 --> 24:01.304
Well, there was
a lot going on

24:01.940 --> 24:04.738
but really, it was
all about nothing

24:06.178 --> 24:08.078
you re just like my mother

24:08.180 --> 24:12.446
mother always said
life is full of tough times

24:41.413 --> 24:44.940
must be a wrong number

24:45.617 --> 24:49.280
no cell phone calls today?

24:50.856 --> 24:53.484
Yeah, the deal's already done

24:55.527 --> 24:57.392
what are you doing?

24:57.496 --> 25:00.090
What? Nothing...

25:02.067 --> 25:05.662
my usual work exhausts me

25:06.171 --> 25:08.662
so i'm keeping my distance

25:10.909 --> 25:15.107
actually, i wanted to
make live action films, too

25:15.914 --> 25:19.008
live action films. Films

25:19.117 --> 25:20.379
films?

25:21.786 --> 25:23.117
Films...

25:23.588 --> 25:26.785
why don't you? Why not?
You should

25:26.892 --> 25:29.520
from now on,
you're "director"

25:29.761 --> 25:31.626
i'll call you director

25:31.997 --> 25:33.658
director...

25:36.201 --> 25:37.361
cut it out

25:39.337 --> 25:40.804
cheers

25:41.106 --> 25:43.973
i want blue, the blue one

25:44.075 --> 25:45.940
this? This blue?

25:46.044 --> 25:47.511
Ready, go

25:47.612 --> 25:50.274
hey, you cheated

25:50.916 --> 25:53.384
it stopped

25:56.288 --> 25:57.880
say, say

25:59.291 --> 26:00.588
say,

26:01.259 --> 26:03.227
know what tomorrow is?

26:03.461 --> 26:07.522
Tomorrow?
Tomorrow's your birthday

26:14.205 --> 26:16.105
you got that right,

26:16.775 --> 26:18.333
director

26:18.810 --> 26:21.005
the 8th day 23 days remain

26:31.523 --> 26:33.081
i m still ok today

26:45.503 --> 26:47.061
i'm finished

27:06.691 --> 27:11.185
yes, yes, i start
shooting today

27:11.296 --> 27:13.264
but there's no telling...

27:13.598 --> 27:16.863
yes, yeah

27:22.407 --> 27:24.807
an outline by...

27:28.246 --> 27:29.645
reel 1

27:33.151 --> 27:34.618
rolling

27:36.554 --> 27:37.782
i'm rolling

27:38.289 --> 27:39.756
i'm shooting you

27:43.328 --> 27:44.886
say something

27:55.106 --> 27:57.040
she seems to have escaped

27:59.044 --> 28:01.137
does my outfit look ok?

28:03.314 --> 28:05.441
Is it right for the film?

28:06.251 --> 28:09.516
Sure, i think it looks fine

28:09.788 --> 28:13.246
i don't know
much about clothes

28:15.527 --> 28:17.324
i'm not up on clothes

28:19.197 --> 28:20.789
it's cute

28:29.007 --> 28:30.474
are you shooting...

28:31.743 --> 28:33.404
it's moving

28:50.595 --> 28:52.028
happy?

28:53.264 --> 28:54.993
Happy on the train?

28:58.970 --> 29:01.370
Happy on the train with you

29:09.714 --> 29:12.239
i've never been here

29:16.087 --> 29:17.816
the unknown

29:19.224 --> 29:20.714
yeah, it's exciting

29:20.959 --> 29:25.419
the streetcar is a perfect means
of escape from the tedium of my days

29:25.830 --> 29:29.789
the scenery flows by cinematically
the sound effects are punctual

29:29.901 --> 29:32.563
my fantasy about her expands

29:33.304 --> 29:35.397
i won't be bored for some time

29:35.640 --> 29:40.100
our idle routine, the days i spend
with her, like a lukewarm bath,

29:40.245 --> 29:44.306
her faint smile,
all seem to agree with me

29:44.716 --> 29:48.208
each day, a countdown
towards death

29:48.319 --> 29:49.911
i dare not risk negligence

29:50.188 --> 29:53.646
all the more reason
to film her. I think

29:54.058 --> 29:56.526
lmages, especially animation,

29:56.628 --> 29:59.563
simply embody our
personal and collective fantasies,

29:59.731 --> 30:04.259
manipulating selected information,
and fictional constructs

30:04.602 --> 30:09.733
even live-action film, recording
actuality, does not correspond to reality

30:10.275 --> 30:15.076
conversely, reality, co-opted
by fiction, loses its value

30:15.313 --> 30:18.612
"the inversion of
reality and fiction"

30:18.716 --> 30:21.708
none of this matters
to me anymore

30:22.187 --> 30:25.122
my consciousness,
my reality,

30:25.356 --> 30:28.416
my subject,
all converge in her

30:28.993 --> 30:32.190
certainly, she longs
to escape into fantasy

30:32.430 --> 30:36.093
certainly, i long
to escape from fantasy

30:36.434 --> 30:40.598
i wanted to keep a visual record
of these contradictory phenomena

30:41.105 --> 30:44.541
but, my behavior is really
no more than an excuse

30:44.676 --> 30:49.079
for my inability to communicate
except through images

30:55.053 --> 30:58.545
this is the way to
the mystery basement

30:58.857 --> 31:02.384
no trespassing
because the camera is prohibited,

31:03.328 --> 31:07.389
i cannot show you anymore
your pardon

31:08.733 --> 31:11.725
